-*   Current training step $t$.
-*   Configuration parameters: `refineEvery`, `warmupLength`, `stopSplitAt`, `densifyGradThresh`, `densifySizeThresh`, `splitScreenSize`, `resetInterval`, `resetLogit` [S2, unofficial].
